# Codex raw review transcripts — findings are distilled into the committed *.summary.md
# Codex review transcripts. Each raw transcript is 0.4-3.5 MB; 149 are already
# tracked here totalling ~97 MB, while the 4 `.summary.md` distillations that
# carry the actual review value total 8.9 KB. The previous rule matched only a
# `-raw.md` suffix that no file in this repo has ever used, so it ignored
# nothing. Ignore the directory by default; keeping a file is now the explicit
# act. Note this does NOT untrack the 149 already committed — gitignore does not
# apply to tracked files.
# A nested transcript directory (docs/reviews/round3/) is excluded as a whole
# by a `docs/reviews/*` rule, and git cannot re-include a file inside an
# excluded directory -- so a `.summary.md` written one level down would be
# dropped silently. Exclude by file, re-admit directories, then re-admit
# summaries at any depth. Proven with real files, not read off the docs.
docs/reviews/**
!docs/reviews/**/
!docs/reviews/README.md
!docs/reviews/**/*.summary.md
